# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Registrar and HRMP migration wire types

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds the types a migrator needs to hand parachain registrations and HRMP channels over
      to the pallets that will own them on a system chain: `MigratedPara`, `MigratedParaState`
      and `ReceiveMigratedParas` in `registrar-primitives`; `ChannelId`, `MigratedChannel` and
      `ReceiveMigratedChannels` in `hrmp-primitives`.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: minor
  - name: hrmp-primitives
    bump: major
